{
  "$comment": [
    "The ONLY hand-edited values of the Driftstack design system. Everything in dist/ is generated from this file by build.mjs; `node packages/design-tokens/build.mjs --check` (part of `npm run lint`) fails when dist/ is stale.",
    "The desktop app's light theme is the reference, not a draft: every value here is the app's own (apps/gui-client/src/styles/index.css and tailwind.config.ts), and tests/design-tokens-match-the-gui.test.ts fails when the two disagree. Change the app first, then this file, in the same commit.",
    "Colours are #rrggbb; the generator writes each one both as an `r g b` triplet (--x-rgb, for Tailwind's alpha modifiers) and as hex (--x)."
  ],
  "accent": {
    "$comment": "[data-accent='oxblood'] — the only accent, the same in both modes.",
    "accent": "#a83b4d",
    "accent-hover": "#c8606e",
    "accent-active": "#8d2c3e",
    "accent-fill-hover": "#9a3446",
    "accent-subtle": "#a83b4d",
    "on-accent": "#ffffff",
    "accent-ring-alpha": 0.4
  },
  "modes": {
    "light": {
      "surface-base": "#ebedf2",
      "surface-raised": "#f8f9fb",
      "surface-elevated": "#fdfdfe",
      "surface-inset": "#e0e3ea",
      "surface-divider": "#cdd3dc",
      "ink-primary": "#1a1d23",
      "ink-secondary": "#525863",
      "ink-muted": "#5b6270",
      "ink-inverted": "#ffffff",
      "status-ready": "#086a40",
      "status-busy": "#7b540b",
      "status-error": "#a6352e",
      "status-error-text": "#a6352e",
      "status-idle": "#8a8d99",
      "accent-text": "#8f3241",
      "island": "#0f172a",
      "accent-subtle-alpha": 0.12,
      "shadow-lift": "0 1px 0 rgb(255 255 255 / 0.9) inset, 0 8px 22px -14px rgb(var(--ink-primary-rgb) / 0.35)",
      "shadow-float": "0 18px 40px -20px rgb(var(--ink-primary-rgb) / 0.45)"
    },
    "dark": {
      "surface-base": "#0f172a",
      "surface-raised": "#1e293b",
      "surface-elevated": "#334155",
      "surface-inset": "#0a0f1c",
      "surface-divider": "#475569",
      "ink-primary": "#f1f5f9",
      "ink-secondary": "#cbd5e1",
      "ink-muted": "#94a3b8",
      "ink-inverted": "#0f172a",
      "status-ready": "#34d399",
      "status-busy": "#fbbf24",
      "status-error": "#f87171",
      "status-error-text": "#fd8c8c",
      "status-idle": "#6b7280",
      "accent-text": "#e8a0ab",
      "island": "#050811",
      "accent-subtle-alpha": 0.25,
      "shadow-lift": "0 1px 0 rgb(255 255 255 / 0.05) inset, 0 10px 30px -14px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.8)",
      "shadow-float": "0 18px 40px -18px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.7)"
    }
  },
  "radius": {
    "$comment": "The app's scale: 4px default (buttons, inputs), 6px, 12px for cards and modals, 16px, full for pills.",
    "DEFAULT": "0.25rem",
    "md": "0.375rem",
    "lg": "0.375rem",
    "xl": "0.75rem",
    "2xl": "1rem",
    "full": "9999px"
  },
  "font": {
    "$comment": "The web keeps Geist (it ships the font). The app's own stacks are recorded under `gui` so the parity test can hold them; they are not written to any web output.",
    "sans": ["Geist", "ui-sans-serif", "system-ui", "sans-serif"],
    "mono": ["Berkeley Mono", "JetBrains Mono", "ui-monospace", "SFMono-Regular", "monospace"],
    "gui": {
      "sans": [
        "Geist Sans",
        "-apple-system",
        "BlinkMacSystemFont",
        "Segoe UI",
        "Roboto",
        "system-ui",
        "sans-serif"
      ],
      "mono": [
        "Berkeley Mono",
        "JetBrains Mono",
        "Menlo",
        "Monaco",
        "Consolas",
        "Liberation Mono",
        "monospace"
      ]
    }
  },
  "fontSize": {
    "2xs": ["0.625rem", "0.875rem"]
  },
  "ease": "cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)"
}
